- tools/ros2_jazzy/: the .msg / .srv definitions and the package.xml of
  their packages as distributed with ROS 2 Jazzy
  (/opt/ros/jazzy/share/<package>/), unchanged, and type_hashes.txt, the
  type hashes from the type description JSON files of the same packages.
- data/msgs/: Ruby files generated from those definitions by
  tools/asterism_msggen.rb (each file names, at its top, the definition and
  the package it was made from and the package's license).
- test/msgs/golden_cdr.tsv and test/msgs/test_type_hashes.txt: values
  computed by ROS 2's tools (rclpy, rosidl) in a ROS 2 Jazzy image.

The ROS 2 packages these come from, with the license in their package.xml:

- std_msgs, geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs, nav_msgs, diagnostic_msgs,
  visualization_msgs (ros2/common_interfaces): "Apache License 2.0"
- builtin_interfaces, service_msgs, rcl_interfaces (ros2/rcl_interfaces):
  "Apache License 2.0"
- example_interfaces (ros2/example_interfaces): "Apache License 2.0"
- tf2_msgs (ros2/geometry2): "BSD" (the BSD 3-Clause License of that
  repository; Copyright (c) 2008, Willow Garage, Inc.)

